From: Aishwarya R <aishwarya.r@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 10:54:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] DSCP: Advertise Wi-Fi Alliance Capabilities element in AP mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add support for advertising DSCP policy capabilities in Beacon,
Probe Response, and (Re)Association Response frames.

This is controlled by a configuration option enable_dscp_policy_capa.

When enabled, the AP includes the Wi-Fi Alliance Capabilities element
indicating support for DSCP policy and unsolicited DSCP policy
capabilities, as defined by the Wi‑Fi QoS Management Specification v4.0,
Section 3.4.

Backport of hostap commit 60f2674a4e40. OpenWrt context: ieee802_11.c,
ieee802_11.h, ieee802_11_eht.c: OpenWrt's patch 184 already passes the
station to ieee80211_ml_build_assoc_resp() and builds the per-link
elements in ieee80211_ml_link_elems(), so the element goes there after
the WMM element, and the signature change and its callers are dropped.

Signed-off-by: Aishwarya R <aishwarya.r@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
--- a/src/ap/ap_drv_ops.c
+++ b/src/ap/ap_drv_ops.c
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
 #include "hs20.h"
 #include "wpa_auth.h"
 #include "hw_features.h"
+#include "robust_av.h"
 #include "ap_drv_ops.h"
 
 
@@ -74,7 +75,7 @@ int hostapd_build_ap_extra_ies(struct ho
 			       struct wpabuf **assocresp_ret)
 {
 	struct wpabuf *beacon = NULL, *proberesp = NULL, *assocresp = NULL;
-	u8 buf[200], *pos;
+	u8 buf[208], *pos;
 
 	*beacon_ret = *proberesp_ret = *assocresp_ret = NULL;
 
@@ -119,6 +120,12 @@ int hostapd_build_ap_extra_ies(struct ho
 		goto fail;
 #endif /* CONFIG_FILS */
 
+	pos = hostapd_eid_wfa_capab(hapd, NULL, buf);
+	if (add_buf_data(&beacon, buf, pos - buf) < 0 ||
+	    add_buf_data(&proberesp, buf, pos - buf) < 0 ||
+	    add_buf_data(&assocresp, buf, pos - buf) < 0)
+		goto fail;
+
 	if (!hapd->conf->rsn_override_omit_rsnxe) {
 		pos = hostapd_eid_rsnxe(hapd, buf, sizeof(buf));
 		if (add_buf_data(&assocresp, buf, pos - buf) < 0)
--- a/src/ap/beacon.c
+++ b/src/ap/beacon.c
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
 #include "dfs.h"
 #include "taxonomy.h"
 #include "ieee802_11_auth.h"
